flowchart TD
    Q([user question]) --> SAFE{{safety<br/>crisis risk + on-topic?<br/>sees recent chat history}}
    Q --> PREP[prepare<br/>condense + plan · one call<br/>runs in parallel with safety]
    SAFE --> GATE{gate}
    PREP --> GATE
    GATE -->|crisis| CRISIS[localized crisis helplines<br/>by country]:::stop
    GATE -->|off-topic| REFUSE[polite decline]:::stop
    GATE -->|ok| RET

    subgraph RET [retrieve · per sub-question, parallel]
        direction TB
        SPEC[classify path graph_rag / naive_rag / both<br/>+ speculative vector search, in parallel] --> R1[graph traversal<br/>and / or vector search]
        R1 --> GR1{relevance<br/>grader}
        GR1 -->|correct| KEEP[keep context]:::ok
        GR1 -->|weak| ALT[try the other path]
        ALT --> GR2{relevance<br/>grader}
        GR2 -->|correct| KEEP
        GR2 -->|weak| WEB[web search<br/>vet → chunk → use this turn<br/>embed + ingest in background]
        WEB --> GR3{relevance<br/>grader}
        GR3 -->|correct| KEEP
        GR3 -->|off-topic| NA[no_answer]:::stop
    end

    RET --> SYN[synthesize · Sonnet 5<br/>streams tokens to the UI<br/>concise · educational framing<br/>professional-guidance note on meds]
    SYN --> A([answer, streamed])
    CRISIS --> A
    REFUSE --> A

    classDef stop fill:#fde2e2,stroke:#e57373,color:#7a1f1f;
    classDef ok fill:#e2f5e9,stroke:#66bb6a,color:#1b5e20;
